<BaseLayout title="Pricing — ArchLab" description="Compare ArchLab monthly plans: Starter $19 for 500 credits, Pro $49 for 1,500 credits, and Studio $99 for 4,000 credits. Prices in USD.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/brand-2026/pricing.css" />
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-label">Plans &amp; credits</span><h1>A plan for the way you work.</h1><p>Compare plans without an account. Choose a monthly allowance that fits your work.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="public-plans" aria-label="Monthly plans">
<article class="public-plan"><h3>Starter</h3><p class="plan-price"><strong>$19</strong><span> USD / month</span></p><p><strong>500 credits</strong> every month</p><a class="primary" href="https://client.archlab.pro/pricing">Choose Starter <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article class="public-plan"><h3>Pro</h3><p class="plan-price"><strong>$49</strong><span> USD / month</span></p><p><strong>1,500 credits</strong> every month</p><a class="primary" href="https://client.archlab.pro/pricing">Choose Pro <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article class="public-plan"><h3>Studio</h3><p class="plan-price"><strong>$99</strong><span> USD / month</span></p><p><strong>4,000 credits</strong> every month</p><a class="primary" href="https://client.archlab.pro/pricing">Choose Studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article></div><p class="plans-note">Prices in USD. Sign in or create an account to subscribe. Credits are not a count of renders: usage depends on the operation. Review applicable taxes and billing terms at checkout.</p>
<h2>Understand your credits</h2><p>Different operations can use different amounts of credits. Check the cost shown in the app before generating. For example, 500 credits would cover 50 operations costing 10 credits each; this is an illustration, not a stated render cost.</p>
<h2>Before you subscribe</h2><p>Review the included capabilities, applicable taxes, billing details and subscription controls in the app before paying. For cancellation terms, read our <a href="/terms">terms of service</a> or <a href="/contact">contact ArchLab</a>.</p>
<p><a href="/#pricing">Back to the homepage plans and credit calculator →</a></p>
</div></section></BaseLayout>
